IMPORTANT — MUSIC RIGHTS DISCLAIMER

BeatScout discovers music metadata via the Spotify Web API but NEVER
downloads or re-uses Spotify audio. Videos are only generated from audio
that the operator has a legal right to use (artist uploads, direct
permission, Creative Commons / license-compatible sources, public domain,
or another provider that explicitly permits the use). See README
"Licensing / rights requirements" — comply with the law and with the
platform terms of service.